---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const imageBase = '/images/resources/custom-precision-components-materials-machining';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Custom Precision Components for Scientific Instruments | Maisi Precision"
  description="Explore custom-machined aluminum, copper, PEEK, stainless steel, and 316 stainless steel components for mass spectrometry and scientific instruments."
>
  <article>
    <header class="relative overflow-hidden bg-navy-950 text-white">
      <div class="grid-bg absolute inset-0 opacity-20"></div>
      <div class="absolute -right-28 -top-48 h-130 w-130 rounded-full border border-blue-300/20"></div>
      <div class="container-wide relative py-18 md:py-24">
        <p class="mb-6 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.22em] text-blue-300">Technical guide · Content 007</p>
        <h1 class="max-w-5xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.07] tracking-[-.045em] sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl">
          Custom Precision Components for Scientific Instruments: Materials &amp; Machining Examples
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-7 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300">
          Real-world examples of custom-machined components for mass spectrometry and analytical instruments.
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="bg-white py-14 md:py-20">
      <div class="mx-auto w-[calc(100%-2rem)] max-w-3xl">
        <div class="space-y-6 text-[1.02rem] leading-8 text-slate-700">
          <p>Scientific instruments often require precision components made from different materials, each selected for specific mechanical, electrical, thermal, or environmental requirements.</p>
          <p>At Maisi Precision, we support drawing-based manufacturing of custom components for mass spectrometry systems and other scientific instruments.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-14 space-y-14 md:mt-18 md:space-y-18">
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-.035em] text-navy-950">Precision Components in Different Materials</h2>

            <div class="mt-8 space-y-12 md:space-y-14">
              <section>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-navy-950">Aluminum</h3>
                <p class="mt-3 leading-8 text-slate-700">Custom-machined aluminum components can provide lightweight structural support and precise mounting features within mass spectrometry ion source assemblies.</p>
                <figure class="mx-auto mt-6 w-full max-w-sm overflow-hidden border hairline bg-ice-50">
                  <img
                    src={`${imageBase}/aluminum-ion-source-structural-component.jpg`}
                    alt="Custom-machined aluminum ion source structural component"
                    width="1400"
                    height="1400"
                    loading="lazy"
                    class="aspect-square h-auto w-full object-contain"
                  />
                  <figcaption class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500">Aluminum Ion Source Structural Component</figcaption>
                </figure>
              </section>

              <section>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-navy-950">Copper</h3>
                <p class="mt-3 leading-8 text-slate-700">Copper components are suitable for applications requiring good electrical or thermal conductivity. This example features a cylindrical structure, mounting flange, and precision-machined holes.</p>
                <figure class="mx-auto mt-6 w-full max-w-sm overflow-hidden border hairline bg-ice-50">
                  <img
                    src={`${imageBase}/custom-copper-flanged-component.jpg`}
                    alt="Custom copper flanged component with machined mounting holes"
                    width="1400"
                    height="1400"
                    loading="lazy"
                    class="aspect-square h-auto w-full object-contain"
                  />
                  <figcaption class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500">Custom Copper Flanged Component</figcaption>
                </figure>
              </section>

              <section>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-navy-950">PEEK</h3>
                <p class="mt-3 leading-8 text-slate-700">PEEK offers mechanical strength, electrical insulation, and thermal resistance. This custom support frame demonstrates complex profiles, mounting features, and detailed machining in engineering plastics.</p>
                <figure class="mx-auto mt-6 w-full max-w-sm overflow-hidden border hairline bg-ice-50">
                  <img
                    src={`${imageBase}/precision-machined-peek-support-frame.jpg`}
                    alt="Precision-machined PEEK support frame"
                    width="1400"
                    height="1400"
                    loading="lazy"
                    class="aspect-square h-auto w-full object-contain"
                  />
                  <figcaption class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500">Precision-Machined PEEK Support Frame</figcaption>
                </figure>
              </section>

              <section>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-navy-950">Stainless Steel</h3>
                <p class="mt-3 leading-8 text-slate-700">Stainless steel components are widely used in scientific instruments where mechanical stability, corrosion resistance, and reliable assembly are important.</p>
                <figure class="mx-auto mt-6 w-full max-w-sm overflow-hidden border hairline bg-ice-50">
                  <img
                    src={`${imageBase}/stainless-steel-flanged-housing.jpg`}
                    alt="Stainless steel precision flanged housing"
                    width="1400"
                    height="1400"
                    loading="lazy"
                    class="aspect-square h-auto w-full object-contain"
                  />
                  <figcaption class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500">Stainless Steel Flanged Housing</figcaption>
                </figure>

                <p class="mt-12 leading-8 text-slate-700">This custom-machined vacuum chamber is designed for a mass spectrometry system. Its complex internal cavity, mounting features, and machined surfaces demonstrate the manufacturing requirements of specialized instrument components.</p>
                <figure class="mx-auto mt-6 w-full max-w-sm overflow-hidden border hairline bg-ice-50">
                  <img
                    src={`${imageBase}/mass-spectrometry-vacuum-chamber.jpg`}
                    alt="Custom mass spectrometry vacuum chamber with machined internal cavity"
                    width="1400"
                    height="1400"
                    loading="lazy"
                    class="aspect-square h-auto w-full object-contain"
                  />
                  <figcaption class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500">Mass Spectrometry Vacuum Chamber</figcaption>
                </figure>

                <p class="mt-12 leading-8 text-slate-700">These components feature cylindrical passages, multiple mounting interfaces, and precisely machined connection features for instrument assemblies.</p>
                <figure class="mx-auto mt-6 w-full max-w-sm overflow-hidden border hairline bg-ice-50">
                  <img
                    src={`${imageBase}/316-stainless-steel-flanged-components.jpg`}
                    alt="Custom 316 stainless steel flanged components"
                    width="1400"
                    height="1400"
                    loading="lazy"
                    class="aspect-square h-auto w-full object-contain"
                  />
                  <figcaption class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500">316 Stainless Steel Flanged Components</figcaption>
                </figure>
              </section>

              <section>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-navy-950">PTFE</h3>
                <div class="mt-3 space-y-5 leading-8 text-slate-700">
                  <p>PTFE offers excellent chemical resistance, electrical insulation, and a low coefficient of friction. It is widely used in scientific and analytical instruments for insulating components, spacers, and chemically resistant parts.</p>
                  <p>This example demonstrates custom-machined PTFE components with mounting holes and precise structural features.</p>
                </div>
                <figure class="mx-auto mt-6 w-full max-w-sm overflow-hidden border hairline bg-ice-50">
                  <img
                    src={`${imageBase}/custom-machined-ptfe-components.jpg`}
                    alt="Custom-machined PTFE components with mounting holes and precise structural features"
                    width="1400"
                    height="1400"
                    loading="lazy"
                    class="aspect-square h-auto w-full object-contain"
                  />
                  <figcaption class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500">Custom-Machined PTFE Component</figcaption>
                </figure>
              </section>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-.035em] text-navy-950">Manufacturing Support for Instrument OEMs</h2>
            <div class="mt-6 space-y-5 leading-8 text-slate-700">
              <p>Maisi Precision supports custom component manufacturing based on customer drawings and technical specifications, including:</p>
              <ul class="space-y-3 border-l-2 border-blue-200 pl-6">
                <li>Metallic and engineering plastic components</li>
                <li>Complex cavities, flanges, housings, and structural parts</li>
                <li>Prototyping, small-batch production, and repeat orders</li>
                <li>Manufacturing coordination and dimensional inspection</li>
              </ul>
              <p>With experience in mass spectrometry component manufacturing, assembly, and inspection, our team understands the importance of precision and reliable integration in scientific instruments.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-10 border-t hairline pt-8 leading-8 text-slate-700">
              <p class="font-semibold text-navy-950">Looking for a manufacturing partner for custom instrument components?</p>
              <p class="mt-3">Send your drawings or technical requirements to <a href="mailto:engineering@msprec.com" class="focus-ring font-medium text-navy-800 underline decoration-blue-300 underline-offset-4 hover:text-navy-700">engineering@msprec.com</a>.</p>
              <p class="mt-2">Website: <a href="https://msprec.com" class="focus-ring font-medium text-navy-800 underline decoration-blue-300 underline-offset-4 hover:text-navy-700">https://msprec.com</a></p>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
